Custom Start Framework / 自定义开局框架

=== 中文 ===
1.0.0

首版发布。安装 CustomStartFramework-1.0.0.dll → 游戏 Mods/CustomStartFramework.dll。

- Perk 驱动：UserData/custom-start/{id}/profile.json 定义开局，Mod 启动时自动扫描注册
- 新游戏选中对应 Perk 后注入：items / removeItems、extraCash / extraRent、unlockedUpgrades、factionReputationDelta
- allowedStartTypes 绑定起始职业；[] 或未配置 = 全部职业可见
- 可选 icon.png 自定义 Perk 图标；name / description 支持中英文
- 发布包含 editor/ 配置编辑器

=== English ===
1.0.0

First release. Install CustomStartFramework.en-1.0.0.dll → Mods/CustomStartFramework.dll.

- Perk-driven custom starts via UserData/custom-start/{id}/profile.json; auto-scanned on mod load
- When the perk is active: inject items / removeItems, extraCash / extraRent, unlockedUpgrades, factionReputationDelta
- allowedStartTypes limits visible start types; [] or omitted = all start types
- Optional icon.png; name / description support zh/en in profile JSON
- Release includes editor/ profile tool
